lection\">67-df-uniform-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e6c8c75d056b765\" href=\"?note=0e6c8c75d056b765\" title=\"67-df-compositional-partial-truth\">67-df-compositional-partial-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7c8c1b19ad8b296f\" href=\"?note=7c8c1b19ad8b296f\" title=\"67-df-hierarchy-interface\">67-df-hierarchy-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"discussion of RFN_S"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已检查逐句实例化的本地推导；Fact 10 部分真接口构造未在此重新证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 使用同一个标准有效呈示和证明表示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4837cec0530b35f0\" href=\"?note=4837cec0530b35f0\" title=\"67-df-uniform-reflection\">67-df-uniform-reflection</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPT}(U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hierarchy}(c,r,b)\\)</span> 参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。层级覆盖由本册 Hierarchy 接口的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(g(\\varphi))\">\\(b(g(\\varphi))\\)</span> 条件明确给出；部分真双条件和可证代入条件在 CPT 中明列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\\forall\\rho\\in\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\rho\\Bigr)\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\mathrm{URefl}(T)\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>每个固定句子属于某个复杂度类；将其代码数词代入该类反思句，并用 PA 可证的类成员性与部分真双条件，即得到对应局部实例。取逻辑矛盾句得到内部一致性句。</p>\n<p>来源第 52 页关于 uniform reflection 蕴含 local reflection 的陈述和局部反思的一致性实例已核对。结论依赖给定的部分真接口；不是由一般逐数正确但无 PA 内真值双条件的任意公式推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-uniform-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"4837cec0530b35f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-uniform-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"d404f437f90ff5f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-compositional-partial-truth","status":"resolved","id":"0e6c8c75d056b765","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-compositional-partial-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-hierarchy-interface","status":"resolved","id":"7c8c1b19ad8b296f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnch